Source: dotfiles-benedict
Package: dotfiles-benedict
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Origin: tea-cats
Depends: zsh, vim, ncurses-term, kitty-terminfo
Recommends: htop, screen, lsof, strace, git
Essential: no
Maintainer: Benedict Harcourt <ben@tea-cats.co.uk>
Description: Configuration files for benedict
 This package contains the default configuration
 files for Benedict Harcourt.
 If one does not already exist, an account called
 'benedict' will be created on your system, with
 shell '/bin/zsh' and home '/home/benedict', and will
 be added to the `_ssh`, `adm`, and `sudo` groups.
 To suppress this behaviour, create the user before
 installing the package.
 .
 Configuration files are included for:
 .
  * zsh
  * vim
  * htop
  * screen
